<title>MEXICO: Geo $50 million Eurobond oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Geo $50 million Eurobond oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican builder Corporacion Geo placed an oversubscribed $50 million five-year Eurobond on Friday, a company official said.</p>
<p>&quot;It has already been placed. It was for $50 million for five years and it was oversubscribed by four times over,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>((--Monterrey newsroom, +528 3457617))</p>
</text>
